    "evidence": "/tmp/plato-lighteval-dependency-checks/command-semantics.json",
    "fact": "After llm_eval provisioning, a syncing uv run WITHOUT --extra llm_eval can retain installed Lighteval while replacing xxhash3.8.1 with incompatible4.0.1. Presence is not compatible environment proof.",
    "docs_rule": "EVERY syncing Lighteval command must include --extra llm_eval, preferably --locked --python3.13. Alternatively documented two-step locked uv sync --extra llm_eval followed by uv run --no-sync or direct owned interpreter is valid. Do not show plain syncing uv run after install.",
